  "description": "A perfect lightweight commuter bike\n\nThe Urbano is your go-to option for versatile rides, from daily commutes to weekend adventures. Weighing just 26 lbs, this lightweight commuter bike promises a smooth journey whether you’re on urban roads or exploring off-trail paths. Its core features such as genuine Shimano 8-speed gearing and V-style brakes ensure efficiency and reliability.\n\nShimano gearing for versatile rides\n\nEquipped with renowned Shimano 8-speed gearing, this bicycle adapts effortlessly to diverse terrains. The all-aluminum alloy construction encompasses components like the frame, hubs, chainring, crankset, brake levers, and more. These high-quality parts contribute to the bike's robust yet lightweight nature.\n\nAdaptability with multi-terrain tires\n\nDesigned for varied surfaces, the Urbano's multi-terrain tires provide outstanding grip and stability. With a comfortable saddle and aluminum double wall rims, every ride becomes a pleasant experience.",
